      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261215">SSE2</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261217">Divide packed double precision floating-point values in xmm1 by packed double precision floating-point values in xmm2/mem.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261219">VEX.128.66.0F.WIG 5E /r</para>
